cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Code and data for: Count the gradings, not the questions: how far each conclusion of a small paired evaluation is from being overturned
message: If you use this code or data, please cite this archive and the manuscript.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Zeyu
    family-names: Fu
    email: fuzeyu99@126.com
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0001-8329-0108'
